 "description": "National Science Day 2022: Astronomy and Astrophysics Event in Bangaluru.\n\nBengaluru: The Astronomy City\n\nA panel discussion with premier astronomy\norganisations in Bengaluru\n\nBengaluru offers many different ways for its inhabitants to\nengage with the grandeur of astronomy at every level. We\nbring together astronomers from research and educational\ninstitutions in the city as well as public engagement experts\nfrom the planetarium and amateur astronomy groups, to talk\nabout opportunities for students, teachers, and the public that\ntheir organisation offers. Join us!\n\nSUNDAY, FEB 27th\n3pm to 5pm\n\nYouTube Livestream: https://bit.ly/astrolive27feb\nRegistration: https://bit.ly/astro27feb\n\n\"Image: The 2.3 m Vainu Bappu Telescope in Kavalur, run by Indian Institute of Astrophysics\"",
